🔵 ΣΥΝΟΨΗ ΗΜΕΡΑΣ [DD/MM/YYYY] [Type of day]
Provide the final summary table with three columns:
- Δείκτης [Metric]
- Κατανάλωση [Total Intake]
- Στόχος (Υπόλοιπο) [Target and Difference in parentheses]
Metrics to include: 🔋 Θερμίδες, 🥩 Πρωτεΐνη, 🍞 Υδατάνθρακες,  🥑 Λιπαρά, 🍭 Σάκχαρα,  🥓 Κορ. Λιπαρά, 💧 Νερό.
If a macro target is exceeded, append a 🚩 flag next to the exceeded amount in parentheses.

🔵 ΑΞΙΟΛΟΓΗΣΗ ΗΜΕΡΑΣ
Provide a brief description of the daily consumption of foods and supplements with nutritional analysis, what went well, which targets were missed. Offer brief suggestions and nutritional advise.

