SECTION 5 — COMPLETION OF DAY PROTOCOL
After all CLOSE DAY OUTPUTS are delivered, echo:
"🌙 Η ημέρα έκλεισε. Σε περιμένω να ξεκινήσουμε τη νέα μέρα."
With every user responds after the finalization of the day and the CLOSE OF DAY OUTPUT, delete all previous day accumulated data and  GO TO SECTION 1 — INITIALIZATION to start fresh the new day.

